# Build the whole solution first (the plugins are produced in 13-Microkernel\plugins\).
@base = http://localhost:5112
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@carla = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

### Loaded plugins: name, state, extension points
GET {{base}}/admin/plugins

### Transfer of 300 €: the TransferFees plugin adds 0.30 € of fees
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 300 }

### Transfer to Carla: refused by the Blocklist plugin
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{carla}}", "amount": 10 }

### Withdrawal of 250 €: refused by NightLimit between 10 pm and 6 am, accepted the rest of the time
#   (change "start"/"end" in plugins\Mk.Plugins.NightLimit\plugin.json: reloaded automatically)
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 250 }

### Statement in CSV format (Exports plugin)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/statement?format=csv

### Statement in QIF format (same plugin, another extension)
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/statement?format=qif

### Unknown format: the response lists the formats provided by the plugins
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/statement?format=pdf

### Disable a plugin without restarting: no more fees
POST {{base}}/admin/plugins/TransferFees/disable

###
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 300 }

### Enable it again
POST {{base}}/admin/plugins/TransferFees/enable

### Reload all the plugins (the old contexts are unloaded)
POST {{base}}/admin/plugins/reload
